dialect protocol
protocol en1994.mutations
version 1
schema norm.en1994.mutations
start record
framing record

# Real `En1994Mutation` op frame: `format u8` (`OP_BINARY_FORMAT`) then `tag u8`, then the kind's own payload.
# Each record is one mutation kind at its wire tag. This file is the only source of those tags: the codec
# derives every tag from these records at compile time (`dsl::protocol_record::tag_u8`).
